Kinan KVM Client - third-party notices
======================================

OpenH264
--------

This application decodes H.264 video using the OpenH264 library
published by Cisco Systems, Inc. The library is **not** bundled with
this project. On first launch the application downloads it from
ciscobinary.openh264.org, verifies its SHA-256 against a pinned list,
and caches it in the user's data directory.

Fetching the official Cisco binary places the use of OpenH264 under
Cisco's "OpenH264 Binary License", which covers the H.264 royalties for
that binary. The license text is at:

    https://www.openh264.org/BINARY_LICENSE.txt

Source code for the library (BSD 2-Clause) is hosted at:

    https://github.com/cisco/openh264

